1
00:01:09,360 --> 00:01:10,240
Liu Guang.

2
00:01:12,320 --> 00:01:13,050
Are you busy?

3
00:01:14,039 --> 00:01:14,640
Boss Hu.

4
00:01:15,800 --> 00:01:17,000
What brings you here?

5
00:01:17,720 --> 00:01:18,650
That phone call,

6
00:01:18,760 --> 00:01:21,620
you answered but didn't speak. What does that mean?

7
00:01:22,240 --> 00:01:22,840
Boss Hu.

8
00:01:24,080 --> 00:01:25,039
We had a deal.

9
00:01:26,080 --> 00:01:27,140
My brother is gone.

10
00:01:27,960 --> 00:01:29,820
I'll handle the transportation.

11
00:01:30,440 --> 00:01:31,500
It's been decided.

12
00:01:32,160 --> 00:01:33,289
It can't be changed.

13
00:01:43,759 --> 00:01:45,289
This batch of goods of yours

14
00:01:45,600 --> 00:01:48,259
is more than two trucks over what's on the books.

15
00:01:57,320 --> 00:02:00,180
This wood belonged to Zhao Zhiguo back then, right?

16
00:02:02,680 --> 00:02:05,410
You two brothers did the truck bombing back then.

17
00:02:20,960 --> 00:02:21,600
Brother.

18
00:02:23,480 --> 00:02:24,340
How about this.

19
00:02:25,360 --> 00:02:26,290
You wait one day.

20
00:02:28,360 --> 00:02:29,120
Just one day.

21
00:02:31,000 --> 00:02:32,160
I'll find Xiaohu,

22
00:02:33,280 --> 00:02:35,410
and you help me take him out of Xinchun.

23
00:02:36,079 --> 00:02:36,680
Okay?

24
00:02:38,440 --> 00:02:39,040
Master Hu.

25
00:02:40,079 --> 00:02:41,880
Tomorrow morning at the latest.

26
00:02:42,440 --> 00:02:44,840
If we don't leave, we'll all be doomed here.

27
00:02:45,480 --> 00:02:47,280
Cao Jin is watching too closely.

28
00:02:48,280 --> 00:02:50,210
There's nothing we can do about it.

29
00:02:50,360 --> 00:02:51,000
Okay.

30
00:02:52,520 --> 00:02:54,250
That's all I need to hear. Okay.

31
00:02:55,280 --> 00:02:57,340
I'll find Xiaohu as soon as possible,

32
00:02:57,840 --> 00:02:59,970
and you help me take him out of Xinchun.

33
00:03:01,880 --> 00:03:03,940
I won't charge you for the materials.

34
00:03:31,360 --> 00:03:32,400
Uncle Wang.

35
00:03:33,200 --> 00:03:34,660
At Benteng Internet Cafe,

36
00:03:35,040 --> 00:03:36,920
I saw Teng Xiaohu.

37
00:03:45,240 --> 00:03:47,440
Uncle Wang, I just sent you a message.

38
00:03:47,560 --> 00:03:49,079
When I looked up, he was gone.

39
00:03:49,079 --> 00:03:49,960
Are you okay?

40
00:03:50,520 --> 00:03:52,980
But I don't know where Teng Xiaohu ran off to.

41
00:03:54,280 --> 00:03:55,480
Did you call the police?

42
00:03:55,480 --> 00:03:56,040
Yes.

43
00:03:56,120 --> 00:03:57,800
Didn't I tell you never to call the police?

44
00:03:57,800 --> 00:03:58,400
Well,

45
00:03:58,400 --> 00:04:00,880
Teng Xiaohu's last incident caused a huge uproar.

46
00:04:00,880 --> 00:04:02,160
I was really afraid something would happen.

47
00:04:02,160 --> 00:04:04,220
Answer their questions truthfully.

48
00:04:07,520 --> 00:04:08,850
Did you call the police?

49
00:04:09,680 --> 00:04:11,410
Are you sure it was Teng Xiaohu?

50
00:04:11,600 --> 00:04:12,560
I couldn't be wrong.

51
00:04:12,560 --> 00:04:13,760
I've seen him before.

52
00:04:13,880 --> 00:04:14,880
You two stay here.

53
00:04:15,000 --> 00:04:16,200
Xiao Ma, come with me.

54
00:04:16,240 --> 00:04:16,800
Okay.

55
00:04:21,800 --> 00:04:22,640
Wang Hong!

56
00:04:23,560 --> 00:04:25,220
I helped you look into things.

57
00:04:25,880 --> 00:04:27,480
And you called the cops on me?

58
00:04:39,320 --> 00:04:40,320
Mom, don't wait up for me tonight.

59
00:04:40,320 --> 00:04:41,320
Stop right there.

60
00:04:45,400 --> 00:04:46,000
Come here.

61
00:04:46,920 --> 00:04:47,520
Sit down.

62
00:04:48,440 --> 00:04:50,440
Eat some noodles while they're hot.

63
00:04:55,520 --> 00:04:56,600
Where are you going now?

64
00:04:56,600 --> 00:04:58,460
To find Uncle Wang and the others.

65
00:04:58,680 --> 00:04:59,810
These past few days,

66
00:05:00,080 --> 00:05:02,160
you've been running around with Wang Hong and his guys.

67
00:05:02,160 --> 00:05:03,600
What do you mean running around?

68
00:05:03,600 --> 00:05:05,880
I'm helping Uncle Wang investigate things every day.

69
00:05:05,880 --> 00:05:07,160
I'm very busy.

70
00:05:08,480 --> 00:05:10,400
I haven't talked to you for a few days.

71
00:05:10,400 --> 00:05:11,560
Did you miss me?

72
00:05:14,640 --> 00:05:15,480
From now on,

73
00:05:15,720 --> 00:05:18,160
stop going out with Wang Hong and the others.

74
00:05:18,160 --> 00:05:18,800
Why?

75
00:05:19,200 --> 00:05:20,520
Uncle Wang is one of us.

76
00:05:20,600 --> 00:05:21,480
You're a girl.

77
00:05:21,480 --> 00:05:24,480
Running all over Xinchun with those men all day,

78
00:05:24,600 --> 00:05:26,720
what does that look like?

79
00:05:26,720 --> 00:05:28,000
What's wrong with it?

80
00:05:28,080 --> 00:05:29,000
Aren't I working for our

81
00:05:29,000 --> 00:05:30,480
savior?

82
00:05:30,560 --> 00:05:33,960
What kind of serious business requires a child to take risks?

83
00:05:34,640 --> 00:05:36,200
Do you know what they are investigating?

84
00:05:36,200 --> 00:05:37,000
What?

85
00:05:37,760 --> 00:05:38,820
Something deadly.

86
00:05:39,200 --> 00:05:40,520
It's exactly because it's deadly

87
00:05:40,520 --> 00:05:41,640
that I have to go.

88
00:05:42,480 --> 00:05:43,120
Mom,

89
00:05:43,600 --> 00:05:45,040
why is it that whenever the past is mentioned,

90
00:05:45,040 --> 00:05:47,440
you become a completely different person?

91
00:05:47,480 --> 00:05:48,080
Hurry up.

92
00:05:48,240 --> 00:05:49,720
Go inside and pack your bags.

93
00:05:49,720 --> 00:05:51,320
I'm telling you, next month you're going to Aunt Wang's.

94
00:05:51,320 --> 00:05:52,440
I've already talked to her.

95
00:05:52,440 --> 00:05:53,760
You'll take tutoring classes there.

96
00:05:53,760 --> 00:05:55,360
You're like this every time.

97
00:05:55,360 --> 00:05:57,000
When have I ever?

98
00:05:57,240 --> 00:05:58,560
I'm telling you, I've already found a school.

99
00:05:58,560 --> 00:06:00,560
You'll go back to school in the spring.

100
00:06:00,560 --> 00:06:01,400
I'm not going.

101
00:06:01,520 --> 00:06:02,680
I'm not going anywhere.

102
00:06:02,680 --> 00:06:03,920
It's not up for discussion.

103
00:06:03,920 --> 00:06:05,200
I don't believe this.

104
00:06:05,200 --> 00:06:07,280
Why are you so stubborn?

105
00:06:07,280 --> 00:06:08,600
Go inside! What are you doing?

106
00:06:08,600 --> 00:06:09,280
What do you mean?

107
00:06:09,280 --> 00:06:10,200
You think I can't control you?

108
00:06:10,200 --> 00:06:11,520
Why are you so disobedient?

109
00:06:11,520 --> 00:06:12,560
Why are you running around?

110
00:06:12,560 --> 00:06:13,840
Just stay at home.

111
00:06:15,240 --> 00:06:15,880
Mom!

112
00:06:17,000 --> 00:06:17,800
Open the door!

113
00:06:18,760 --> 00:06:19,960
Open the door!

114
00:06:30,600 --> 00:06:31,240
Hey, bro.

115
00:06:31,720 --> 00:06:33,680
People have been going in and out of the illegal lumber mill.

116
00:06:33,680 --> 00:06:35,080
I'm afraid they'll run away early.

117
00:06:35,080 --> 00:06:35,960
Where's Uncle San?

118
00:06:35,960 --> 00:06:37,560
I've already informed Uncle San.

119
00:06:37,560 --> 00:06:38,620
He'll be here soon.

120
00:06:38,680 --> 00:06:39,810
Watch them closely.

121
00:06:39,840 --> 00:06:40,360
Don't let them get away.

122
00:06:40,360 --> 00:06:41,490
I'll be right there.

123
00:06:42,440 --> 00:06:43,370
What's going on?

124
00:06:43,520 --> 00:06:44,600
They're trying to run away early.

125
00:06:44,600 --> 00:06:46,120
Ergui and I are going to keep an eye on them.

126
00:06:46,120 --> 00:06:47,000
I'll go with you. I'll drive.

127
00:06:47,000 --> 00:06:47,640
Okay.

128
00:06:54,159 --> 00:06:55,360
Officer Cao, this is Wang Hong.

129
00:06:55,360 --> 00:06:55,960
Mr. Wang.

130
00:06:56,080 --> 00:06:56,800
What's up?

131
00:06:57,159 --> 00:06:58,600
I know you're investigating the illegal timber.

132
00:06:58,600 --> 00:06:59,680
It's an emergency.

133
00:06:59,920 --> 00:07:01,760
Teng Laohu's men are probably going to run.

134
00:07:01,760 --> 00:07:03,120
The address is behind the abandoned brick factory.

135
00:07:03,120 --> 00:07:04,040
How do you know?

136
00:07:04,400 --> 00:07:05,280
I don't have time to explain.

137
00:07:05,280 --> 00:07:06,720
Cao Jin, trust me this once.

138
00:07:06,720 --> 00:07:08,240
It'll be too late if you delay.

139
00:07:08,240 --> 00:07:08,960
Stay safe.

140
00:07:08,960 --> 00:07:09,800
Keep your phone on.

141
00:07:09,800 --> 00:07:10,530
I'm on my way.

142
00:07:23,960 --> 00:07:24,600
Brother.

143
00:07:24,800 --> 00:07:26,460
When are we loading the truck?

144
00:07:27,040 --> 00:07:27,840
Five o'clock.

145
00:07:29,120 --> 00:07:30,280
Have you counted everything?

146
00:07:30,280 --> 00:07:31,280
Yes, all counted.

147
00:07:31,920 --> 00:07:32,560
Okay.

148
00:07:34,280 --> 00:07:35,000
Brothers.

149
00:07:36,680 --> 00:07:38,280
After we deliver this batch,

150
00:07:39,240 --> 00:07:40,900
we can all have a good New Year.

151
00:07:41,159 --> 00:07:42,490
Thanks, Brother Guang.

152
00:07:43,520 --> 00:07:44,780
Don't worry, brother.

153
00:07:51,720 --> 00:07:52,360
Ergui.

154
00:07:53,000 --> 00:07:54,800
You and Xuefei watch this door.

155
00:07:54,880 --> 00:07:56,740
Third Uncle, let's go over there.

156
00:07:57,120 --> 00:07:57,650
Let's go.

157
00:08:09,760 --> 00:08:10,690
What do you mean?

158
00:08:11,520 --> 00:08:13,320
Are you guys going on a long trip?

159
00:08:13,720 --> 00:08:15,180
Is it any of your business?

160
00:08:16,000 --> 00:08:18,060
We're here to talk business with you.

161
00:08:18,360 --> 00:08:19,820
Old Korean pine business.

162
00:08:22,080 --> 00:08:22,640
Brother.

163
00:08:23,240 --> 00:08:25,100
Are you really here for business?

164
00:08:59,280 --> 00:08:59,960
Stop!

165
00:09:00,720 --> 00:09:02,800
Don't move!

166
00:09:03,640 --> 00:09:04,680
Hey, don't run!

167
00:09:04,680 --> 00:09:05,280
Stop!

168
00:09:05,640 --> 00:09:07,970
Put your hands on your head and squat down!

169
00:09:13,600 --> 00:09:14,280
Don't run!

170
00:09:15,400 --> 00:09:16,080
Stop!

171
00:09:17,360 --> 00:09:18,880
Stop! Don't run!

172
00:09:52,440 --> 00:09:53,120
Get up.

173
00:09:54,880 --> 00:09:55,680
Take him away.

174
00:09:56,240 --> 00:09:57,800
Xiao Ma, grab the bag.

175
00:10:02,880 --> 00:10:03,640
Keep close.

176
00:10:08,400 --> 00:10:09,730
The intel was accurate.

177
00:10:09,960 --> 00:10:10,560
Thank you.

178
00:10:11,280 --> 00:10:12,280
Just doing my job.

179
00:10:14,160 --> 00:10:15,160
You can head back.

180
00:10:15,320 --> 00:10:16,080
Later,

181
00:10:16,400 --> 00:10:18,660
we'll need you to come in for a statement.

182
00:10:19,160 --> 00:10:19,640
Okay.

183
00:10:20,200 --> 00:10:20,800
I'm off.

184
00:10:28,520 --> 00:10:29,200
Chief Wang.

185
00:10:30,680 --> 00:10:31,410
Officer Cao.

186
00:10:33,080 --> 00:10:34,140
I took a quick look.

187
00:10:34,440 --> 00:10:35,200
In the warehouse,

188
00:10:35,200 --> 00:10:38,200
most of it is Korean pine illegally logged in recent years.

189
00:10:38,200 --> 00:10:39,730
But some of it is different.

190
00:10:40,640 --> 00:10:42,440
It's been stored for a long time,

191
00:10:42,880 --> 00:10:44,040
the color is darker,

192
00:10:44,440 --> 00:10:45,920
and some of it is already moldy.

193
00:10:45,920 --> 00:10:47,040
On the cut surfaces,

194
00:10:47,040 --> 00:10:50,120
there are traces of what appears to be artificial paint.

195
00:10:50,120 --> 00:10:51,520
It was sanded down later,

196
00:10:51,920 --> 00:10:53,080
but not completely.

197
00:10:54,320 --> 00:10:55,640
Our preliminary conclusion is that

198
00:10:55,640 --> 00:10:58,040
the trees were all over a hundred years old.

199
00:10:58,320 --> 00:10:59,780
They were probably logged

200
00:11:00,320 --> 00:11:01,720
over a decade ago.

201
00:11:10,160 --> 00:11:11,880
Thanks for your hard work today.

202
00:11:11,880 --> 00:11:13,640
Keep this batch of wood safe.

203
00:11:14,000 --> 00:11:15,480
I'll need to inspect it later.

204
00:11:15,480 --> 00:11:17,800
I haven't had the chance to thank you, Officer Cao.

205
00:11:17,800 --> 00:11:19,260
If it weren't for your tip,

206
00:11:19,360 --> 00:11:21,090
our Forest Protection Section

207
00:11:21,160 --> 00:11:22,960
wouldn't have caught this gang.

208
00:11:23,480 --> 00:11:24,200
But,

209
00:11:24,360 --> 00:11:27,290
is there a problem with this batch of old Korean pine?

210
00:11:29,480 --> 00:11:30,560
Nothing major.

211
00:11:31,160 --> 00:11:32,760
This batch of old Korean pine

212
00:11:34,320 --> 00:11:35,120
might be related to a case

213
00:11:35,120 --> 00:11:36,800
I was investigating.

214
00:11:38,800 --> 00:11:39,530
Understood.

215
00:11:41,160 --> 00:11:42,360
Thanks for your help.

216
00:11:42,480 --> 00:11:43,560
Thanks, Chief Wang.

217
00:11:43,560 --> 00:11:44,160
See you.

218
00:11:44,560 --> 00:11:45,160
See you.

219
00:11:45,160 --> 00:11:45,640
I'm off.

220
00:11:45,800 --> 00:11:46,400
Take care.

221
00:11:55,440 --> 00:11:56,640
Nian'er, time to eat.

222
00:12:04,520 --> 00:12:05,200
Time to eat.

223
00:12:08,080 --> 00:12:09,200
Eat it or don't.

224
00:12:17,760 --> 00:12:19,200
It must be Uncle Wang and the others.

225
00:12:19,200 --> 00:12:20,200
I'll get the door.

226
00:12:36,200 --> 00:12:36,960
Master Hu.

227
00:12:37,240 --> 00:12:38,370
Master Hu, bad news.

228
00:12:38,960 --> 00:12:40,040
Did you find Xiaohu?

229
00:12:40,040 --> 00:12:41,480
No, it's Liu Guang.

230
00:12:41,640 --> 00:12:42,840
Liu Guang got busted.

231
00:12:43,240 --> 00:12:44,480
Right at the old brick factory.

232
00:12:44,480 --> 00:12:46,480
He was caught red-handed by the police and the Forestry Protection Section.

233
00:12:46,480 --> 00:12:47,040
The goods were confiscated.

234
00:12:47,040 --> 00:12:48,570
He was arrested on the spot.

235
00:12:48,720 --> 00:12:49,920
When did this happen?

236
00:12:49,960 --> 00:12:51,520
Last night, right before dawn.

237
00:12:51,520 --> 00:12:54,440
The police and the Forestry Protection Section are interrogating him right now.

238
00:12:54,440 --> 00:12:56,440
Do you think Liu Guang will rat us...

239
00:12:57,440 --> 00:12:58,320
Okay, I got it.

240
00:12:59,920 --> 00:13:01,720
Master Hu, I say we leave immediately.

241
00:13:01,720 --> 00:13:03,440
Before Liu Guang gives us up.

242
00:13:03,440 --> 00:13:04,840
We still have time to run.

243
00:13:05,720 --> 00:13:06,640
I can't leave.

244
00:13:07,600 --> 00:13:09,000
I have to wait for Xiaohu.

245
00:13:10,040 --> 00:13:12,360
See who among our brothers wants to leave.

246
00:13:12,360 --> 00:13:13,690
Tell them to go quickly.

247
00:13:14,960 --> 00:13:16,360
I have to wait for Xiaohu.

248
00:13:19,160 --> 00:13:19,840
Okay.

249
00:13:20,640 --> 00:13:21,480
I understand.

250
00:13:33,920 --> 00:13:34,520
Brother.

251
00:13:34,640 --> 00:13:36,800
We didn't find Liu Guang in the household registry back then

252
00:13:36,800 --> 00:13:37,800
because the two brothers

253
00:13:37,800 --> 00:13:39,520
were not registered together.

254
00:13:39,520 --> 00:13:42,320
Liu Guang was registered with a distant relative.

255
00:13:42,800 --> 00:13:43,560
Liu Guang,

256
00:13:44,400 --> 00:13:46,000
you and your brother Liu Ming

257
00:13:46,520 --> 00:13:47,980
hid yourselves very well.

258
00:13:48,400 --> 00:13:49,400
For so many years,

259
00:13:50,280 --> 00:13:51,920
one was responsible for stealing,

260
00:13:51,920 --> 00:13:53,480
and the other for transporting.

261
00:13:53,480 --> 00:13:55,080
You cooperated flawlessly.

262
00:14:00,840 --> 00:14:02,700
Do you know how your brother died?

263
00:14:05,360 --> 00:14:06,090
I don't know.

264
00:14:07,000 --> 00:14:08,800
Right before your brother died,

265
00:14:09,400 --> 00:14:10,800
whose call did he answer?

266
00:14:11,920 --> 00:14:12,650
I don't know.

267
00:14:13,040 --> 00:14:15,170
Then who ordered you to steal the wood?

268
00:14:15,640 --> 00:14:16,570
I don't know him.

269
00:14:16,840 --> 00:14:17,720
Liu Guang.

270
00:14:18,320 --> 00:14:19,800
You better fix your attitude.

271
00:14:19,800 --> 00:14:20,400
Xiao Ma.

272
00:14:20,840 --> 00:14:22,100
What's with that look?

273
00:14:24,920 --> 00:14:25,480
Fine.

274
00:14:26,760 --> 00:14:28,420
Let me ask you something else.

275
00:14:28,800 --> 00:14:30,400
Yesterday, in your factory,

276
00:14:30,680 --> 00:14:32,400
there was a batch of old Korean pine.

277
00:14:32,400 --> 00:14:34,530
They were all over a hundred years old,

278
00:14:34,640 --> 00:14:35,840
and they were cut down

279
00:14:36,120 --> 00:14:37,400
over a decade ago.

280
00:14:38,920 --> 00:14:40,520
Where did the wood come from?

281
00:14:48,400 --> 00:14:49,160
Liu Guang.

282
00:14:49,840 --> 00:14:52,440
You've been hiding in the shadows for so many years.

283
00:14:52,440 --> 00:14:55,100
Now your brother has died an unexplained death.

284
00:14:56,240 --> 00:14:57,900
Now that you're sitting here,

285
00:14:58,080 --> 00:15:00,200
speaking out about certain things

286
00:15:00,960 --> 00:15:02,290
might not be a bad thing.

287
00:15:08,600 --> 00:15:09,600
Liu Guang, I'm giving you a chance.

